              "text": "ઝીલવું (jhīlvũ) is to catch something thrown or falling. CDIAL lists Marathi jhelṇẽ, \"to catch\", and Hindi jhelnā, \"to undergo; to take\", under a reconstructed jhēlati, \"undergoes\" (CDIAL 5413); it gives no Gujarati form, so its history is not settled."
